# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# The Dockerfile currently COPYs only src/, models/, data/, seed_data/ and
# knowledge/, so this file changes nothing today. It exists to make a future
# broad `COPY . .` safe: without it, that one-line change would bake the real
# credentials in `.env` and the runtime session database into the image.

# ---- Secrets (never in an image) ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.tmp
*.pem
*.key

# ---- VCS / tooling ----
.git
.gitignore
.github
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
*/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.venv
venv

# ---- Runtime state (regenerated locally, never shipped) ----
# SQLite writes sidecars as `-wal` / `-shm` and `-journal`; `data/sessions_json/`
# holds per-session snapshots.
data/sessions.db
data/sessions.db-wal
data/sessions.db-shm
data/sessions.db-journal
data/sessions_json/

# ---- Demo build intermediates ----
results/_frames/
results/pitch_preview/

# ---- Local scratch / documentation noise ----
_s4.py
*.log
